{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Seven is a single-player auto-battler roguelike strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different units to create powerful synergies, choose between risks and rewards in each battle, and push through increasingly challenging stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all your units are defeated in battle, you\u2019ll get them back. However, if you wipe out all enemy units and win, any allied units that died in that battle will be lost for good.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the beginning of the world, every race was born with two hearts: one of sin, and the other of virtue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divided by these two hearts, the races have hated each other and fought endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after thousands of years, the war never stopped, and sin has rooted itself deeper than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806030/extras/b015a9fe065f5d6e821879095ddc43d9.avif?t=1765375173\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you are born in the name of virtue to end this war once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: conquer sin, break it down, and erase the last trace of corruption from this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806030/extras/87fafc3b0e8cbc3f72648254edb72313.avif?t=1765375173\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until this fight is over, you cannot stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806030/extras/7add4410e2fd4d33481ee2bdbf23b82b.avif?t=1765375173\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Updates</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806030?t=1765375173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806030?t=1765375173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806030/f9697740f39caaf14bd79dd2c35dcefd6e3bc004/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765375173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806030/f9697740f39caaf14bd79dd2c35dcefd6e3bc004/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765375173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3858360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Seven is a single-player auto-battler roguelike strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different units to create powerful synergies, choose between risks and rewards in each battle, and push through increasingly challenging stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all your units are defeated in battle, you\u2019ll get them back. However, if you wipe out all enemy units and win, any allied units that died in that battle will be lost for good.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the beginning of the world, every race was born with two hearts: one of sin, and the other of virtue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divided by these two hearts, the races have hated each other and fought endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after thousands of years, the war never stopped, and sin has rooted itself deeper than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http